ew sits on the **Work** calendar; the only other-calendar noise is the Edge cases filler events.","createdAt":1793759314123}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"Here''s **Thu Oct 8, 2026** — the review day — across your visible calendars (all UTC):\n\n- **09:00–09:15** — **Daily standup** · Work calendar · linkroom.app/r/standup\n- **09:00–09:15** — **Daily forever** · Edge cases calendar (a recurring filler event)\n- **10:00–13:00** — **Workshop: packaging prototypes** · Work · Studio 2 · you, Raj, Priya\n- **13:00–13:30** — **Print vendor call (Pune)** · Work · linkroom.app/r/print-vendor · you + Priya\n- **15:00–16:00** — **Design review** · Work · Studio 2 ← the rebrand review slot\n\nAlso spanning the whole day: **Ten year all-day event** on the **Edge cases** calendar (Jan 1 2026 – Jan 1 2036, background filler).\n\nSo the day is fairly full: standup, a three-hour packaging workshop, the print vendor call, and then the 15:00 review back-to-back after the vendor call (only a 30-min buffer is eaten — the print call ends 13:30, so there''s a gap until 15:00). Everything except the standup and the review sits on the **Work** calendar; the only other-calendar noise is the Edge cases filler events."}','assistant','v2','2026-11-04T02:28:34.047Z','f0c4be98-b2fd-59d7-b11e-c921e7d22615');
