hem would give payee names. Let me get Sep 25 and Sep 12. But that adds a turn. The user asked a question; better to answer well. I''ll fetch the two most recent debit emails.\n\nHmm, but I should just answer. Yet payee detail matters a lot (\"money moving out\" — to whom?). Let me fetch Sep 25 and Sep 12 bodies in parallel."}],"createdAt":1793759320659},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0","from":"Konkan Bank","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"INR 1,250.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Fri Sep 25 2026 04:10:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Customer, INR 1250.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 25-09-26. UPI Ref 427311009876.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 48,210.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call-2018039c-f5b5-4fa0-a388-2f740b43438d","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwOV0"}},"updatedAt":1793759320671},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5MV0","from":"Konkan Bank","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"INR 450.00 debited from a/c **4821","date":"Sat Sep 12 2026 06:55:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Dear Customer, INR 450.00 has been debited from account **4821 to\r\nVPA chaiwala.store@konkan on 12-09-26. UPI Ref 427310102947.\r\nAvailable balance: INR 49,460.55.\r\nNot you? Call 1800 266 4821 to block your account."},"toolCallId":"call-a9d1c3f4-01fd-4a6f-8fa5-cb2f2b4209cb","toolName":"getEmail","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDM5MV0"}},"updatedAt":1793759320672},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1793759320674,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Both to chaiwala.store@konkan (