odboard to Kenji on Friday\n\n## Budget check\n\n| Line | Planned | Spent |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Photography | EUR 2,400 | EUR 0 |\n| Print tests | EUR 600 | EUR 180 |\n\n> The mark has to read at 8 mm on the bottom of a cup.\n\n```\nprint size: 8mm, min stroke 0.25pt\n```\n"},"toolCallId":"call-c6e0d0ba-5c3b-4b0f-82ea-6045fa5faee0","toolName":"getFileText","args":{"driveId":"36600459-5ed5-55e6-8cb3-f158ce3b8910","fileId":"Team/Meeting notes 2026-10-05.md"}},"updatedAt":1793759579866},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","count":1,"ids":["WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwN10"]},"toolCallId":"call-3321429a-c602-4f43-8a7f-c732e99dbc8c","toolName":"listReadLater","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1793759579867},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","count":1,"scheduled":[{"scheduleId":"d4bf2f82-42ec-5a58-8768-b9b2d7e1803b","scheduledFor":"2099-01-05T09:00:00.000Z","status":"pending","sent":false,"unconfirmed":false,"subject":"Moodboard for the rebrand","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"scheduledBy":"Ana Silva","scheduledByYou":true,"error":null}]},"toolCallId":"call-df1a546f-b475-4618-8f3f-686b1ef584a2","toolName":"listScheduled","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1793759579868},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@demo.trymetis.email","count":0,"emails":[]},"toolCallId":"call-d627384a-0a64-46c9-bdfb-529217a8fa7f","toolName":"listSnoozed","args":{"mailboxId":"2509b3b7-2ea9-5861-9415-92dd8cc89134"}},"updatedAt":1793759579869},{"type":"step-start","createdAt":1793759579872,"model":"openai-compatible.chat/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor"},{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"Now I have data. Real events (non-bulk, non-edge):\n\nThis week (Nov 2–8, 2026), real calendar items:\n- Mon Nov 2, 09:00–09:15 — Daily standup (W